WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
mg to mcg. Two units for the same mass.
A free calculation guide from BACwater.ai.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
1 mg = 1,000 mcg. Multiply milligrams by 1,000.
The unit changes. The mass stays the same.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
0.125 mg = 125 mcg.
To reverse it: 125 divided by 1,000 = 0.125 mg.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Try your own numbers: bacwater.ai/tools/mg-to-mcg.
